# 689. Payment Callback

Flow.

```
Gateway

↓

Backend Callback

↓

Verify Signature

↓

Update Payment

↓

Generate Receipt

↓

Send Notification

↓

Done
```

Flutter **tidak pernah menerima callback langsung** dari gateway.

